  "id": "actuarial-risk-assessment",
  "term": "actuarial risk assessment",
  "definition": "Actuarial risk assessment is the use of structured risk assessment tools to estimate how likely an outcome such as violence is. These tools are judged by how well they distinguish higher-risk from lower-risk people and how closely their predicted risk matches what actually happens.",
